        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana 6SB, Heavy Duty Solid Brass Surface Door Bolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nDecorative door bolts made of Heavy Duty Solid Brass. It is available in 11 different finishes. The guides are held in place with a unique ball bearing system that eliminates scratches on the barrel of the bolt, prevents rattling of the bolt, holds the bolt in any position, and ensures a smooth sliding action. Each 6 inch surface bolt is supplied with 3 strikes: universal, mortise, and angle strike with matching solid brass phillip's head screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-6SB.gif?v=1704354669\" width=\"600\" height=\"346\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana 6SB 6 Inch Surface Bolt Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: \r\n<a href=\"/products/solid-brass-8-inch-surface-bolt-deltana-8sb\"><b>Deltana 8SB 8\" Surface Bolt</b></a> - \r\n<a href=\"/products/solid-brass-12-inch-surface-bolt-deltana-12sb\"><b>Deltana 12SB 12\" Surface Bolt</b></a> - \r\n<a href=\"/products/solid-brass-18-inch-surface-bolt-deltana-18sb\"><b>Deltana 18SB 18\" Surface Bolt</b></a> - \r\n<a href=\"/products/solid-brass-24-inch-surface-bolt-deltana-24sb\"><b>Deltana 24SB 24\" Surface Bolt</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the DEL-6SB 6 Inch Surface Bolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Bolt Length: 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Bolt Throw: 1-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Bolt Width: 5/8\" Diameter Half Round Rod</li>\r\n<li>Width of Guides: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rod Resistance: 109 lbs</li>\r\n<li>Strikes: Includes 3 Strikes</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/6SB.pdf?v=1691095268\"><b>Deltana 6SB 6\" Surface Bolt Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Solid Brass 6 Inch Surface Bolt",
                "description": "Heavy Duty Solid Brass Surface Door Bolt, Deltana 6SB - Decorative door bolts made of Heavy Duty Solid Brass. It is available in 11 different finishes. The guides are held in place with a unique ball bearing system that eliminates scratches on the barrel of the bolt, prevents rattling of the bolt, holds the bolt in any position, and ensures a smooth sliding action. Each 6 inch surface bolt is supplied with 3 strikes: universal, mortise, and angle strike with matching solid brass phillip's head screws.",
                "keywords": "DEL-6SB Brass 6 Inch Heavy Duty Door Bolts, deltana 6SB surface bolts, decorative door bolt, surface mounted door bolts, door security door bolts, deltana surface bolts heavy duty solid brass, 6 inch door bolts, 6 inch Surface Bolts, door slide bolts, deltana 6 inch slidebolts, DEL-6SB3, DEL-6SB5, DEL-6SB3-UNL, DEL-6SB10B, DEL-6SB15, DEL-6SB15A, DEL-6SB14, DEL-6SB19, DEL-6SB26, DEL-6SB26D, DEL-6SB003,"
